@startuml C4-Dynamic-ScimProvisioning
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Dynamic — User lifecycle from Explore IAM to Explore AI (SCIM 2.0)

autonumber
actor "IAM Administrator" as admin
participant "IAM Console\n/users" as console <<ui>>
participant "IAM Identity +\nAudit (same tx)" as iam <<java>>
participant "ScimPushListener\n(after commit)" as push <<java>>
participant "IAM /oauth2/token" as token <<java>>
participant "AI ScimSecurityConfig +\nScimAccountService" as aiscim <<java>>
participant "AI feature modules\nchat · rag · skill · pipeline ·\nautomation · metrics" as modules <<java>>

admin -> console: Create / disable / delete user
console -> iam: REST call
iam -> iam: Change User, publish domain event\nAdminActivity identity:* (same transaction)
iam --> console: 201 / 200 / 204

iam -> push: UserProvisioned / UserDeactivated /\nUserDeleted event (ids only)
push -> token: client_credentials iam-scim-outbound\nscope write:ai_scim (cached)
token --> push: Access token

alt Create
  push -> aiscim: POST /scim/v2/Users\nexternalId = IAM user id, userName, email, displayName
  aiscim -> aiscim: Check JWT issuer and SCOPE_write:ai_scim\n(401 / 403 SCIM error otherwise)
  aiscim --> push: 201 + Location + ETag
else Disable
  push -> aiscim: PUT /scim/v2/Users/{id} (active = false, If-Match)
  aiscim --> push: 200 · sign-in now fails ACCOUNT_INACTIVE
else Delete
  push -> aiscim: DELETE /scim/v2/Users/{id}
  aiscim -> modules: OwnerErasureRequestedEvent (same transaction)
  modules -> modules: Each module deletes its own owner rows\nChatSessionsErasedEvent → metrics
  aiscim -> aiscim: Delete account
  aiscim --> push: 204
end
push -> push: Record remote id and synced version

note over push, aiscim
  5xx / 429: retry with backoff; incomplete publications are resubmitted every 5 minutes and on restart
  Enterprise IdPs provision IAM the same way (client_credentials, scope write:iam_scim)
end note

@enduml
